    wcpa_dj_llsm_isic_contraction Ω W hW hWt A K L 𝔭 u v g a' b hRo hRI hPD ha'm ha'0 hbm hb0
      ⟨e, he⟩ hnba hbg hAo hIs hCirc y₀ hy₀ hy₀c Qo 𝔷o QI 𝔷I hQoy hQIy hQoN hQIN h𝔷oQ h𝔷IQ
