    intro i
    obtain ⟨s', hs', hmem⟩ := wcpa_dj_llsm_kpkn_rh_coeff_vanish Ω W A K L 𝔭 ℓ u v ε ε' δ h θ ψ a
      s e c hℓ hfr hε hθpow hψpow hθψ hhm huv huv0 hcoord hCD hI2 hs hc hL i
